      "title": "$z^2$ 在 $1+i$ 的導數",
      "prompt": "$f(z)=z^2$，求 $f'(1+i)$，並用實部虛部檢查。",
      "steps": [
        "$(z^2)'=2z$，$f'(1+i)=2+2i$。",
        "檢查：沿實軸方向的差商就是 $\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial x}=u_x+i\\,v_x$。$u=x^2-y^2$、$v=2xy$。",
        "在 $(1,1)$：$u_x=2x=2$，$v_x=2y=2$，所以 $f'=2+2i$。一致。"
      ],
      "answer": "$2+2i$",
      "claim": "D(x^2-1, 1) == 2 ;; D(2*x*1, 1) == 2"
    },
    {
      "title": "$\\bar{z}$ 的差商跟方向有關",
      "prompt": "證明 $f(z)=\\bar{z}$ 在任何一點都不可微。",
      "steps": [
        "差商 $\\frac{f(z+h)-f(z)}{h}=\\frac{\\bar{z}+\\bar{h}-\\bar{z}}{h}=\\frac{\\bar{h}}{h}$，跟 $z$ 無關。",
        "沿直線 $h=t(1+im)$（$t$ 實數 $\\to 0$）：$\\frac{\\bar{h}}{h}=\\frac{1-im}{1+im}$，實部 $\\frac{1-m^2}{1+m^2}$。",
        "$m=0$（實軸）得 $1$，$m=1$ 得 $0$。方向不同、值不同，極限不存在，所以處處不可微。"
      ],
      "answer": "處處不可微",
      "claim": "LIM((x^2-x^2)/(x^2+x^2), 0) == 0 ;; LIM(x^2/x^2, 0) == 1"
    },
    {
      "title": "高次方",
      "prompt": "$f(z)=z^4$，求 $\\operatorname{Re}f'(1+i)$。",
      "problemId": "der-085",
      "steps": [
        "$f'(z)=4z^3$。$(1+i)^2=2i$，$(1+i)^3=2i(1+i)=-2+2i$。",
        "$f'(1+i)=4(-2+2i)=-8+8i$，實部 $-8$。",
        "用 $u_x+i\\,v_x$ 檢查：$u=x^4-6x^2y^2+y^4$、$v=4x^3y-4xy^3$；在 $(1,1)$，$u_x=4-12=-8$，$v_x=12-4=8$。"
      ],
      "answer": "$-8$",
      "claim": "D(x^4-6*x^2+1, 1) == -8 ;; D(4*x^3-4*x, 1) == 8"
    }
  ],
